# A commit that failed is acknowledged as applied.
MODULE: AckedResolvedFailedCommitAcknowledged
TARGET: AckedResolved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed commit is acknowledged
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
    /\ IF r = "Ok" THEN Acknowledge(cur) ELSE FailAttempt
    /\ UNCHANGED <<val, late, pol, seen, judged, appended, reported, lostLeft, dlq, parked>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF r # "Lost" THEN Acknowledge(cur) ELSE FailAttempt
    /\ UNCHANGED <<val, late, pol, seen, judged, appended, reported, lostLeft, dlq, parked>>
--- END